WEBVTT

00:18.200 --> 00:19.830
Morimiya... Aono.

00:19.830 --> 00:20.830
Morimiya... Aono.

00:22.250 --> 00:23.920
You're... not here.

00:23.920 --> 00:24.870
You're... not here.

00:32.170 --> 00:32.970
That's right.

00:33.630 --> 00:35.260
You're not allowed to be here.

00:37.010 --> 00:38.800
Good-bye... Matsuri.

00:38.800 --> 00:40.010
Good-bye... Matsuri.

00:55.270 --> 01:01.690
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

00:55.270 --> 01:01.690
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

01:02.110 --> 01:08.740
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

01:02.110 --> 01:08.740
Though I only want to set my heart on them

01:09.740 --> 01:16.000
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

01:09.740 --> 01:16.000
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

01:16.630 --> 01:23.720
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

01:16.630 --> 01:23.720
But I want to touch you now

01:23.930 --> 01:29.850
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

01:23.930 --> 01:29.850
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

01:30.260 --> 01:38.270
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

01:30.260 --> 01:38.270
An illusion showed me memories

01:39.340 --> 01:48.280
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

01:39.340 --> 01:48.280
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

01:48.450 --> 01:53.370
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

01:48.450 --> 01:53.370
Trembling with a foreboding

01:53.660 --> 02:01.710
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

01:53.660 --> 02:01.710
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

02:02.090 --> 02:11.430
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

02:02.090 --> 02:11.430
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

02:16.420 --> 02:22.650
At the End of a Promise

02:42.220 --> 02:43.300
What should I do?

02:45.010 --> 02:46.100
At this rate...

02:46.430 --> 02:48.060
At this rate, I'm done for.

03:42.070 --> 03:44.120
What was that noise?

03:46.370 --> 03:47.700
Where are you going, Yorito?

03:50.790 --> 03:51.830
Matsuri...

04:16.940 --> 04:17.940
It's okay.

04:19.570 --> 04:20.900
It's okay... Aono.

04:20.900 --> 04:21.780
It's okay... Aono.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.860
Don't!

05:20.090 --> 05:21.340
Why?

05:33.020 --> 05:34.480
Who... are you?

05:34.480 --> 05:35.230
Who... are you?

05:42.970 --> 05:44.440
She's not here either, huh?

05:47.030 --> 05:50.280
Where did Mayuko run off to?

05:50.990 --> 05:52.490
Excuse me.

05:54.160 --> 05:54.870
I'm fine.

05:55.540 --> 05:56.660
Don't mind me.

05:57.000 --> 06:00.500
Um, I saw your daughter yesterday.

06:01.130 --> 06:02.170
Where?!

06:02.170 --> 06:04.630
S-She was together with Yaka-san.

06:05.090 --> 06:06.510
What did you say?!

06:14.930 --> 06:16.180
You've regained consciousness?

06:16.980 --> 06:17.940
I...

06:18.640 --> 06:20.270
Why am I alive?

06:20.730 --> 06:21.690
What's that?

06:21.690 --> 06:23.150
You wanted to die?

06:24.940 --> 06:28.030
It's better for me if I'm not here.

06:28.740 --> 06:30.280
It always has been.

06:30.700 --> 06:31.490
Oh?

06:32.240 --> 06:37.080
But it seems like those kids have been searching for you for quite a while now.

06:43.500 --> 06:45.420
Seems like no one is here.

06:46.050 --> 06:47.130
Besides,

06:49.260 --> 06:52.260
this place isn't normal.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.640
Yorito!

06:55.350 --> 06:56.970
Get a hold of yourself, Yorito!

06:57.270 --> 06:58.770
What's going on?

07:03.360 --> 07:04.440
Yorito...

07:09.450 --> 07:12.740
This is Aono-san's origami...

07:17.240 --> 07:18.250
Yorito.

07:19.330 --> 07:21.170
I promise I'll...

07:32.090 --> 07:33.510
Hello, this is Ishizuki speaking.

07:34.640 --> 07:35.800
Yorito?

07:36.140 --> 07:38.390
No, he isn't here.

07:39.430 --> 07:42.190
He must've gone shopping in town.

07:42.390 --> 07:44.150
I'm sure he'll return home soon.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.110
Yes... understood.

07:46.110 --> 07:47.070
Yes... understood.

07:47.480 --> 07:50.110
I'll contact you if he comes here right away.

07:55.990 --> 07:57.080
Yorito...

08:02.040 --> 08:03.000
What is it?

08:03.540 --> 08:04.540
Umm, well...

08:04.790 --> 08:08.420
It seems like Mother and Father will come home late.

08:08.630 --> 08:09.960
What are you talking about?

08:10.210 --> 08:12.090
Isn't it like that every day?

08:12.380 --> 08:14.840
And in the refrige-

08:15.090 --> 08:16.140
There's curry, right?

08:16.510 --> 08:17.550
They told me this morning.

08:18.060 --> 08:20.810
Um, there's more than enough curry left.

08:21.680 --> 08:22.480
And?

08:22.680 --> 08:26.520
I believe having dinner with more people makes the meal taste better.

08:27.190 --> 08:28.440
What are you trying to say?

08:29.440 --> 08:30.780
Well...

08:31.570 --> 08:33.400
We could call Aono-san,

08:33.400 --> 08:36.370
and have a curry party with every-

08:39.410 --> 08:41.910
Forget I said anything.

08:56.140 --> 08:56.800
Here.

08:58.470 --> 09:00.470
I didn't know what you liked,

09:00.930 --> 09:03.060
so I bought one of every thing they had in stock.

09:03.680 --> 09:04.980
Just eat whatever you like.

09:05.390 --> 09:06.480
Thank you.

09:06.940 --> 09:10.020
But I can't eat all of it.

09:10.070 --> 09:10.940
Why?

09:11.360 --> 09:13.110
You haven't regained enough energy to eat?

09:13.400 --> 09:15.400
No, that's not it.

09:17.240 --> 09:18.530
A lot has happened,

09:18.820 --> 09:21.120
and I was thinking about what I should do.

09:21.120 --> 09:22.080
And also...

09:24.160 --> 09:26.870
Oh well, I guess I should eat something fir-

09:26.870 --> 09:28.420
Tattered bunny punch!

09:28.420 --> 09:29.460
What was that for?

09:29.920 --> 09:31.880
The <i>foie gras</i> one is mine.

09:38.890 --> 09:39.800
Are you all right?

09:40.260 --> 09:41.100
Yeah.

09:42.100 --> 09:43.470
Thank you... for worrying about me.

09:43.470 --> 09:44.850
Thank you... for worrying about me.

09:46.480 --> 09:49.020
Saying that with teary eyes is...

09:49.480 --> 09:50.610
Guess you're right.

09:55.030 --> 09:55.650
The trolley's here.

10:06.120 --> 10:07.890
The remaining onigiri...

10:30.230 --> 10:31.020
Yaka.

10:52.580 --> 10:53.500
Yes?

10:53.500 --> 10:54.550
Who is it?

10:56.050 --> 10:57.260
Aono-san.

10:57.840 --> 10:59.930
Yorito hasn't come back.

11:01.590 --> 11:03.550
I-Is that so?

11:05.220 --> 11:06.600
Let me see Yorito.

11:07.520 --> 11:09.230
He's not here!

11:09.600 --> 11:10.060
Liar.

11:12.230 --> 11:15.070
Aren't you the one who's lying?

11:15.940 --> 11:18.780
What are you hiding from Yorito?

11:18.820 --> 11:20.400
That's none of your business.

11:20.450 --> 11:23.280
Then is it something that concerns Matsuri-san?

11:25.330 --> 11:26.580
I'm sorry...

11:26.870 --> 11:28.450
Please go home for tonight.

11:56.150 --> 11:57.730
You won't escape this time.

12:15.210 --> 12:17.040
I've finally reached the end of my journey.

12:18.090 --> 12:20.880
With this sword and your blood,

12:21.340 --> 12:24.180
I can fulfill the promise I made that day.

12:30.390 --> 12:31.730
Say, Takeshi.

12:31.890 --> 12:33.560
Don't call me Takeshi!

12:33.890 --> 12:36.100
Tsujidou sounds much cooler!

12:36.100 --> 12:39.610
Takeshi is easier to pronounce than Tsujidou.

12:39.610 --> 12:40.860
You know... that's not the point!

12:40.860 --> 12:42.690
You know... that's not the point!

12:42.990 --> 12:44.240
Okay then.

12:45.110 --> 12:47.490
Then you'll call me Mayuko.

12:49.950 --> 12:51.290
No... that's not what I meant...

12:51.290 --> 12:53.870
No... that's not what I meant...

12:54.670 --> 12:57.630
That's exactly why you don't have any friends.

12:58.460 --> 12:59.840
And do you have any friends, Takeshi?

13:01.920 --> 13:03.090
I...

13:04.300 --> 13:06.220
I told you to call me Tsujidou!

13:21.940 --> 13:23.070
Thank you... for walking me home.

13:23.070 --> 13:24.320
Thank you... for walking me home.

13:24.700 --> 13:26.070
You don't have to thank me.

13:27.910 --> 13:28.700
Oh yeah.

13:29.160 --> 13:31.620
Next week is your birthday, right, Kamikawa?

13:32.040 --> 13:33.120
It is.

13:33.370 --> 13:35.330
Is there anything you want?

13:35.750 --> 13:37.080
Can I get anything?

13:38.250 --> 13:41.460
Well, if possible, within the limits of my allowance.

13:42.170 --> 13:43.880
There isn't much in there, is there?

13:43.880 --> 13:45.090
Shut up!

13:45.090 --> 13:46.720
Just hurry up and tell me what you want!

13:47.470 --> 13:49.340
A plush bunny.

13:50.470 --> 13:52.680
But look, you already have one-

13:52.720 --> 13:53.770
Bunny punch!

13:54.020 --> 13:55.640
Why did you suddenly do that for?!

13:55.850 --> 13:58.560
Dolls get lonely too, right?

13:58.850 --> 13:59.810
That's why.

14:00.560 --> 14:02.020
Okay, I got it.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.320
Bye!

14:05.610 --> 14:06.990
See ya tomorrow!

14:23.590 --> 14:24.630
Poor girl.

14:24.630 --> 14:25.920
I heard it was a robbery.

14:26.880 --> 14:28.180
The whole family?

14:28.680 --> 14:31.600
The child didn't have to die...

14:59.710 --> 15:00.750
Kamikawa...

15:12.550 --> 15:13.800
Kamikawa!

15:13.800 --> 15:15.560
You're alive?

15:16.470 --> 15:17.810
What's wrong with you? Really...

15:18.680 --> 15:20.140
You scared the hell-!

15:20.140 --> 15:21.100
No, you're wrong...

15:22.400 --> 15:23.810
I... really did die.

15:23.810 --> 15:25.070
I... really did die.

15:25.480 --> 15:27.070
What are you talking about?

15:27.070 --> 15:28.820
You're standing right in front of me.

15:28.820 --> 15:30.400
They're called Yaka.

15:31.200 --> 15:31.950
Yaka?

15:32.240 --> 15:37.580
Some strange girl came and said that I died and became a Yaka.

15:38.250 --> 15:40.620
B-But, Yaka or whatever,

15:40.910 --> 15:42.040
you're still alive.

15:42.040 --> 15:42.960
You're wrong!

15:55.510 --> 15:57.220
I... can't go out in the sun anymore.

15:57.220 --> 15:59.310
I... can't go out in the sun anymore.

16:01.430 --> 16:03.560
This isn't being human...

16:07.520 --> 16:09.400
I want to... cross over to that world...

16:09.400 --> 16:11.280
I want to... cross over to that world...

16:21.200 --> 16:24.000
Stop that.

16:25.580 --> 16:26.590
Takeshi...

16:27.500 --> 16:28.340
I'll...

16:28.710 --> 16:32.720
I'll take you back to the world you used to live in!

16:33.590 --> 16:34.630
For sure!

16:34.890 --> 16:35.890
I promise you.

16:36.430 --> 16:38.890
I'll turn you back to normal, Mayuko.

17:06.960 --> 17:07.790
I will...

17:08.340 --> 17:09.460
I will! For sure!

17:12.550 --> 17:14.470
Please, disappear!

17:20.680 --> 17:21.810
It's useless.

17:21.810 --> 17:24.390
Your Yaka powers can't affect this sword!

17:41.950 --> 17:42.830
Oh no!

17:43.160 --> 17:44.040
This is...!

18:06.600 --> 18:07.690
<i>I promise you.</i>

18:08.100 --> 18:10.770
<i>I'll turn you back to normal, Mayuko.</i>

18:13.320 --> 18:15.280
STOP-!

18:18.610 --> 18:19.450
Mayuko!

18:20.490 --> 18:21.490
Step aside!

18:21.870 --> 18:22.830
Just a little more...

18:23.120 --> 18:24.540
Just a little more and I'll-!

18:24.540 --> 18:25.750
You mustn't!

18:27.250 --> 18:28.250
It's okay now.

18:28.710 --> 18:30.000
That's enough.

18:30.170 --> 18:31.250
Why?!

18:31.840 --> 18:33.550
With her life,

18:33.880 --> 18:36.800
I can turn you back to human!

18:36.800 --> 18:37.630
No!

18:38.550 --> 18:42.800
I don't want to return to normal if I have to sacrifice someone else.

18:44.180 --> 18:45.180
That...

18:46.220 --> 18:49.690
That doesn't mean we can sacrifice your wish!

18:52.690 --> 18:54.480
Your... wish...

18:54.480 --> 18:55.610
Your... wish...

19:02.450 --> 19:03.450
It's all right.

19:04.410 --> 19:07.540
I'm not sacrificing it.

19:09.330 --> 19:10.250
My...

19:11.080 --> 19:13.210
My real wish was...

19:14.790 --> 19:37.860
As I was swept away by gentle, gentle waves...

19:42.030 --> 20:05.100
...I gradually stopped worrying about vanishing.

20:07.060 --> 20:20.650
The remaining feelings go toward somewhere.

20:20.780 --> 20:31.620
Ah... They lose their colors...

20:37.130 --> 21:00.070
...without being noticed by anyone as long as the sun shines.

21:02.070 --> 21:03.070
<i>I promise you.</i>

21:03.570 --> 21:06.200
<i>I'll turn you back to normal, Mayuko.</i>

21:06.870 --> 21:08.620
<i>Until then... I'll always be right beside you.</i>

21:08.620 --> 21:10.790
<i>Until then... I'll always be right beside you.</i>

21:20.960 --> 21:23.170
My wish... was just to have you by my side.

21:23.170 --> 21:25.050
My wish... was just to have you by my side.

21:27.140 --> 21:28.680
With the gentle you,

21:29.180 --> 21:31.010
who hasn't changed since then.

22:13.930 --> 22:22.600
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:13.930 --> 22:22.600
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:23.020 --> 22:31.780
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:23.020 --> 22:31.780
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:31.900 --> 22:36.200
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:31.900 --> 22:36.200
With no time to regret, time will flow

22:36.490 --> 22:41.290
hitori tachidomaru kedo

22:36.490 --> 22:41.290
Even though I stand alone

22:42.540 --> 22:48.050
yume mamoru shirabe  kuchizu samuno

22:42.540 --> 22:48.050
A tune to protect your dreams, I sing to myself

22:48.210 --> 22:52.550
hitobito ga nemuri ni tsukeba

22:48.210 --> 22:52.550
When people go into slumber

22:52.760 --> 23:00.470
mata au hi no negai tsumugeru deshou  ai no ito

22:52.760 --> 23:00.470
Their wish to unite can be woven. The thread of love

23:00.770 --> 23:10.900
yasashisa wo sasou  otogibanashi anata kara osowatta no yo

23:00.770 --> 23:10.900
Fairy tales that elicit kindness I learned that from you

23:11.070 --> 23:20.830
modorimashou  sotto ano koro no omoi ni

23:11.070 --> 23:20.830
Let us return gently to the memories of those times

23:30.600 --> 23:45.610
Next Time

23:30.600 --> 23:45.610
Wavering Dream

23:31.180 --> 23:33.640
Hey, I thought of a new move for your tattered rabbit.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.260
What is it?

23:34.260 --> 23:34.970
Give it to me.

23:35.760 --> 23:36.850
You do it like this.

23:37.060 --> 23:39.430
And go, "Tattered rabbit: sexy pose!"

23:40.600 --> 23:43.100
When should this move be used?

23:43.270 --> 23:45.230
When you want to be a "knock out".
